# Copy to .dev.vars for local development. Never commit .dev.vars.
# Production values are set via
#   wrangler pages secret put <NAME> --project-name admin-gallery-sksat-net --env production
# (production only — preview deployments run unreviewed code).
# Local `pnpm serve` has no Cloudflare Access in front of it; skip the JWT
# check (src/lib/access.ts). Never set this in production.
ACCESS_DISABLED=1
